{"route":"/docs/4.2/content/images/","version":"4.2","renderedVersion":"4.2","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Images","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Documentation and examples for opting images into responsive behavior (so they never become larger than their parent elements) and add lightweight styles to them—all via classes."},"blocks":[{"id":"responsive-images","type":"heading","en":"Responsive images","level":2},{"id":"responsive-images--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Images in Bootstrap are made responsive with <code>.img-fluid</code>. <code>max-width: 100%;</code> and <code>height: auto;</code> are applied to the image so that it scales with the parent element."},{"id":"responsive-images--example-1","type":"demo","key":"5078936181d485a79b07","height":300},{"id":"responsive-images--code-1","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Responsive image\">","language":"html"},{"id":"responsive-images--note-1","type":"note","tone":"warning","body":[{"id":"svg-images-and-ie-10","type":"heading","en":"SVG images and IE 10","level":5},{"id":"svg-images-and-ie-10--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"In Internet Explorer 10, SVG images with <code>.img-fluid</code> are disproportionately sized. To fix this, add <code>width: 100% \\9;</code> where necessary. This fix improperly sizes other image formats, so Bootstrap doesn’t apply it automatically."}]},{"id":"image-thumbnails","type":"heading","en":"Image thumbnails","level":2},{"id":"image-thumbnails--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"In addition to our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/utilities/borders/\">border-radius utilities</a>, you can use <code>.img-thumbnail</code> to give an image a rounded 1px border appearance."},{"id":"image-thumbnails--example-1","type":"demo","key":"b5d8ed9510a604b56512","height":147},{"id":"image-thumbnails--code-1","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" alt=\"...\" class=\"img-thumbnail\">","language":"html"},{"id":"aligning-images","type":"heading","en":"Aligning images","level":2},{"id":"aligning-images--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Align images with the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/utilities/float/\">helper float classes</a> or <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/utilities/text/#text-alignment\">text alignment classes</a>. <code>block</code>-level images can be centered using <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/utilities/spacing/#horizontal-centering\">the <code>.mx-auto</code> margin utility class</a>."},{"id":"aligning-images--example-1","type":"demo","key":"e8d0c57f25ea6c14b0ae","height":174},{"id":"aligning-images--code-1","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"rounded float-left\" alt=\"...\">\n<img src=\"...\" class=\"rounded float-right\" alt=\"...\">","language":"html"},{"id":"aligning-images--example-2","type":"demo","key":"a488e316cf07a6ffecdc","height":147},{"id":"aligning-images--code-2","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"rounded mx-auto d-block\" alt=\"...\">","language":"html"},{"id":"aligning-images--example-3","type":"demo","key":"e84c241016a11c10d62a","height":147},{"id":"aligning-images--code-3","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"text-center\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"rounded\" alt=\"...\">\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"picture","type":"heading","en":"Picture","level":2},{"id":"picture--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"If you are using the <code>&lt;picture&gt;</code> element to specify multiple <code>&lt;source&gt;</code> elements for a specific <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>, make sure to add the <code>.img-*</code> classes to the <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> and not to the <code>&lt;picture&gt;</code> tag."},{"id":"picture--code-1","type":"code","value":"<picture>\n  <source srcset=\"...\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" alt=\"...\">\n</picture>","language":"html"}],"demos":[{"key":"5078936181d485a79b07","html":"\n  <svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img bd-placeholder-img-lg img-fluid\" width=\"100%\" height=\"250\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder: Responsive image\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect fill=\"#868e96\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"></rect><text fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\" x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\">Responsive image</text></svg>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"b5d8ed9510a604b56512","html":"\n  <svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img img-thumbnail\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A generic square placeholder image with a white border around it, making it resemble a photograph taken with an old instant camera: 200x200\"><title>A generic square placeholder image with a white border around it, making it resemble a photograph taken with an old instant camera</title><rect fill=\"#868e96\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"></rect><text fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\" x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\">200x200</text></svg>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example bd-example-images"},"sprite":""},{"key":"e8d0c57f25ea6c14b0ae","html":"\n  <svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img rounded float-left\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder: 200x200\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect fill=\"#868e96\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"></rect><text fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\" x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\">200x200</text></svg>\n  <svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img rounded float-right\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder: 200x200\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect fill=\"#868e96\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"></rect><text fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\" x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\">200x200</text></svg>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example bd-example-images"},"sprite":""},{"key":"a488e316cf07a6ffecdc","html":"\n  <svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img rounded mx-auto d-block\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder: 200x200\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect fill=\"#868e96\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"></rect><text fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\" x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\">200x200</text></svg>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example bd-example-images"},"sprite":""},{"key":"e84c241016a11c10d62a","html":"\n  <div class=\"text-center\">\n    <svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img rounded\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder: 200x200\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect fill=\"#868e96\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"></rect><text fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\" x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\">200x200</text></svg>\n  </div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example bd-example-images"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Theming","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/theming/"},{"en":"Build tools","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/build-tools/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getboo